621 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 158 0 R
/E (0x3B = 0011 1011. Mandatory bits present: \(0x3B AND 0x0F\) = 0x0B. Missing mask = 0x0F XOR 0x0B = 0x04, so bit 2 \(barometric altimeter\) is missing. Inhibitor check: \(0x3B AND 0x10\) = 0x10, so bit 4 fault is active; \(0x3B AND 0x20\) = 0x20, so bit 5 over-temperature warning is active; \(0x3B AND 0x80\) = 0x00, so bit 7 is clear. Result: FLIGHT NOT READY. )
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [28]
>>
endobj
